{"type":"tool_result","callId":"chatcmpl-tool-81253660cd08de6a","status":"completed","result":"762:function carriesTokenGateStamp(content: string): boolean {\n812:  const value = carriesTokenGateStamp(spec) ? (values.find(statusIsComplete) ?? values[0]) : values[0];\n842:    const tokenGated = carriesTokenGateStamp(content);\nfunction carriesTokenGateStamp(content: string): boolean {\n  for (const line of content.split(/\\r?\\n/u).slice(0, 70)) {\n    const stamp = TEMPLATE_STAMP_RE.exec(line);\n    if (!stamp) continue;\n    const major = Number(stamp[1]);\n    const minor = Number(stamp[2]);\n    return major > TOKEN_GATE_MIN_MAJOR || (major === TOKEN_GATE_MIN_MAJOR && minor >= TOKEN_GATE_MIN_MINOR);\n  }\n  return false;\n}\n\nfunction cleanStatusCell(cell: string): string {\n  return cell.replace(/\\*\\*/gu, '').replace(/`/gu, '').trim();\n=== USER STORIES WRAPPER ===\n- [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Question 1 requiring clarification]\n- [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Question 2 requiring clarification]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:questions -->\n<!-- /IF -->\n<!-- IF level:3,3+ -->\n## 10. RISK MATRIX\n<!-- FILL: List each risk with impact, likelihood and one mitigation. GOOD: R1: a missing `--keep` value deletes every archive. Impact H, likelihood L. Mitigation: a test pins exit 2 before any delete. WEAK: Some risks exist. -->\n\n| Risk ID | Description | Impact | Likelihood | Mitigation |\n|---------|-------------|--------|------------|------------|\n| R-001 | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Risk] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: H/M/L] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: H/M/L] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Strategy] |\n\n---\n\n## 11. USER STORIES\n<!-- FILL: Write one story per user. Name the actor, the want and the benefit. GOOD: As a backup host, I want `--keep 3` to leave 3 archives, so that `logs/archive` stays under its quota. WEAK: Users want the feature. -->\n\n### US-001: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Title] (Priority: P0)\n\n**As a** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: user type], **I want** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: needed behavior], **so that** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: benefit].\n\n**Acceptance criteria:** see `acceptance-criteria.md` (rows referencing this story).\n\n"}
