c-kit-docs.json\"]],\n  [\"f-iter001-005\", \"Required-section enforcement for stamped documents exists: ANCHORS_VALID requires every anchor whose template section is a required H2, but only when the document carries a v2.3+ SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE stamp; a v2.4 spec.md that deletes PROBLEM & PURPOSE fails with a named missing anchor.\", [\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/orchestrator.ts\"]],\n  [\"f-iter001-006\", \"The phase parent is explicitly exempt from ANCHORS_VALID ('Phase parent lean document set accepted'), and the sufficiency loop enforces missing anchors only for timeline.md and goal.md; a phase parent can therefore drop Problem & Purpose entirely and still validate.\", [\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/orchestrator.ts\", \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/spec-doc-structure.ts\"]],\n  [\"f-iter001-007\", \"No validation rule reads the purpose prose: grep counts for 'problem' are zero across the validator modules, and the only content-shaped checks are placeholder tokens and the non-empty-anchor-body check, so a vacuous purpose sentence passes.\", [\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/orchestrator.ts\", \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/spec-doc-structure.ts\", \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/validate.sh\"]],\n  [\"f-iter001-008\", \"goal.md is the only surface with a durable one-line statement of intent ('## 1. DURABLE DIRECTIVE / Objective'), its anchors are required whenever the file exists, and it is a lazy addon, so a packet that never asked for it has no durable directive.\", [\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/addons/goal.md.tmpl\", \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/spec-doc-structure.ts\", \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/spec-kit-docs.json\"]],\n  [\"f-iter001-009\", \"The two successor-facing surfaces carry no purpose field: handover.md has no problem/purpose heading, the _memory.continuity block has recent_action, next_safe_action, blockers, key_files, completion_pct, open_questions and answered_questions but no purpose key, and acceptance-criteria.md has no purpose column.\", [\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/addons/handover.md.tmpl\", \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/core/implementation-summary.md.tmpl\", \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/addons/acceptance-criteria.md.tmpl\"]],\n];\nconst question1 = \"Where are a packet's problem, purpose and user need written today, per level and for a phase parent, and which of those places is required and validated?\";\nconst record = {\n  type: \"iteration\",\n  iteration,\n  runId: SID,\n  sessionId: SID,\n  lineageId: SID,\n  mode: \"research\",\n  target_agent: \"deep-research\",\n  agent_definition_loaded: true,\n  resolved_route: \"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\n  run: iteration,\n  status: \"complete\",\n  focus: \"Q1 — where a packet's problem, purpose and user need are written per level and for a phase parent, and which of those places is required and validated\",\n  findingsCount: findings.length,\n  newInfoRatio: 1.0,\n  noveltyJustification: \"All 9 findings are new: this is the first measurement of the purpose-bearing template sections and their enforcement paths in the validator.\",\n  keyQuestions: [question1],\n  answeredQuestions: [question1],\n  ruledOut: [\"treating PLACEHOLDER_FILLED as a purpose check\", \"treating acceptance-criteria.md as a purpose surface\"],\n  focusTrack: \"purpose-surfaces\",\n  edgeCase: \"contradictory-evidence\",\n  toolsUsed: [\"Read\", \"Grep\", \"Bash\"],\n  sourcesQueried: [\n    \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/core/spec.md.tmpl:99-107\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/packet-types/phase-parent.spec.md.tmpl:63-72\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/addons/handover.md.tmpl:37-121\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/addons/g