hat does it write into _memory.continuity? It likely computes recent_action, next_safe_action etc. from the session. Let me grep generate-context.ts for fields and whether it derives purpose from spec.md (e.g., \"problem\"/\"purpose\" extraction). Earlier grep for \"recent_action\" in generate-context.ts hit. Let me grep for \"purpose|problem|objective|goal\" in generate-context.ts.\n\nLet me batch: collectSummaryLines, generate-context field extraction, buildLoopPrompt."}
