killed/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/resume/resume-ladder.ts\"]],\n  [\"f-iter002-010\", \"/speckit:save's writer contract is mechanics-only: recent_action and next_safe_action (<=96 chars, <=16 words), blockers and key_files (<=5 items), plus completion_pct and question lists; the thin record has no purpose field.\", [\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/continuity/generate-context.ts\", \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/continuity/thin-continuity-record.ts\"]],\n  [\"f-iter002-011\", \"The deep-loop hop is the exception: the child-dispatch brief injects the full research_topic and the iteration prompt pack renders it with focus and remaining questions on every iteration, so research loops restate purpose by construction.\", [\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\", \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl\"]],\n];\nconst q2 = \"For each hop surface, what does it read and what does it emit, and does the purpose travel? Surfaces: the Claude compaction hooks (`runtime/hooks/claude/compact-inject.ts`, `session-prime.ts`) and their counterparts for other runtimes under `runtime/hooks/`, `/speckit:resume`, `/speckit:handoff` and the session relaunch, `/speckit:save` with `generate-context.js`, the deep-loop iteration prompts and child-dispatch briefs.\";\nconst record = {\n  type: \"iteration\", iteration, runId: SID, sessionId: SID, lineageId: SID,\n  mode: \"research\", target_agent: \"deep-research\", agent_definition_loaded: true,\n  resolved_route: \"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\n  run: iteration, status: \"complete\",\n  focus: \"Q2 — what each hop surface reads and emits, and whether the packet's purpose travels\",\n  findingsCount: findings.length,\n  newInfoRatio: 1.0,\n  noveltyJustification: \"All 11 findings are new: this is the first trace of the read/emit payload of every named hop surface and of the continuity facet mapping tha