r purpose travels\" },\n    { type: \"node\", id: \"f-goal-is-next-action\", kind: \"FINDING\", label: \"Continuity facets label next_safe_action as Goal\" },\n    { type: \"node\", id: \"f-resume-signal-shape\", kind: \"FINDING\", label: \"Resume signal has no purpose field\" },\n    { type: \"node\", id: \"s-compact-inject\", kind: \"SOURCE\", label: \"claude compact-inject\", path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/compact-inject.ts\" },\n    { type: \"node\", id: \"s-resume-ladder\", kind: \"S","description":"Write iter-002 delta and record via gateway"},"truncated":true}
