{"type":"thinking","text":"Registry: 48 key findings, 5 resolved, 0 open. \n\nNow write research.md — the synthesis. It must be substantial and answer the five questions with citations. Include:\n- Header/metadata\n- Executive overview\n- Investigation report: Q1-Q5 answers with evidence\n- Measured evidence table\n- Eliminated Alternatives\n- Divergence Map (before Open Questions)\n- Open Questions (none/residual)\n- Convergence Report (appendix)\n- References\n\nCitations must be `[SOURCE: path:line]`. I'll reuse verified line numbers. Where I cite aggregate measurements, use `[INFERENCE: ...]`.\n\nLength: aim for a thorough but readable synthesis (~200-260 lines).\n\nThen closeout with --output research.md --registry findings-registry.json --dashboard deep-research-dashboard.md --stop-reason maxIterationsReached --answered-count 5 --total-questions 5.\n\nThen gateway the staged events (synthesis_complete). Then update config status to complete. Then verify.\n\nLet me write research.md now."}
